// 筛出临期账单提醒候选；显式排除「贷款还款」分类（贷款不提醒，仅跟踪）
const loanCat = $vars.ezb_cat_loan;
const body = $input.item.json || {};
const result = (body && body.result) || body || {};
const txs = Array.isArray(result) ? result : (result.items || []);
const out = [];
for (const tx of txs) {
  // 显式按分类排除贷款：ezB 交易携带 categoryId（嵌套 category.id 兜底）；贷款交易不进提醒
  const catId = (tx.categoryId !== undefined) ? tx.categoryId : (tx.category && (tx.category.id !== undefined ? tx.category.id : undefined));
  if (loanCat && String(catId) === String(loanCat)) continue;
  const c = (tx.comment || '').toString();
  if (/(待付|账单|缴费|续费)/.test(c)) {
    out.push({ json: { txId: tx.id, comment: c, amount: tx.sourceAmount, categoryId: catId } });
  }
}
return out;

// 聚合所有临期账单为单封邮件；无则跳过（不发送）
const items = $input.all().map(i => i.json);
if (items.length === 0) return [];
const esc = s => String(s == null ? '' : s).replace(/[<>&]/g, c => ({'<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','&':'&amp;'}[c]));
const rows = items.map(t => `<li>${esc(t.comment)} — ¥${t.amount}（分类 ${t.categoryId}）</li>`).join('');
const html = `<h3>TaskFIN 账单到期提醒</h3><p>你有 ${items.length} 笔账单临近到期/待付：</p><ul>${rows}</ul><p style="color:#888">— 来自 ezBookkeeping 账单提醒工作流</p>`;
return [{ json: { count: items.length, html } }];
